    qa:priority "P0-gate" ;
    qa:inDomain <https://wod.wiki/qa/domain/feeds> ;
    rdfs:comment "Publication Visibility on a Note is derived from its linked user Notebooks and per-Session opt-in flags (`Private` -> `Published Note` -> `Published Note + Data`). Exporting a Feed repository `.zip` packages only public user Notebooks and public Session telemetry while excluding private Sessions and `notebook/journal`." ;
    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-03/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-03/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-03/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-03/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/FED-03/beat/Prove> .

