    qa:hasStep <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-01/beat/Seed>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-01/beat/Enter>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-01/beat/Sense>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-01/beat/Drive>, <https://wod.wiki/qa/journey/JRN-01/beat/Prove> .

